I'm Luca and i live in Italy.
I am a determined autodidact and eager to learn more and more. I improve myself with books and courses.
My portfolio is focused on 5 key points:
1) Solid stocks with sustainable growth margins & good dividend yeld;
2) growth stocks, i.e. stocks with strong growth potential;
3) ETFs to mitigate risk, both bond & equity, offering dividends;
4) a maximum of 10% in cryptocurrencies;
5) No leverage.
I invest for the long term (years) and aim to achieve a realistic annual return of 5-10% as baseline+the return of growth stocks.
● Minimum copy: $300;
● Stop Loss as wide as possible;
● Copy me for at least 2 years.

As a hobby, i study Python3.

