userDetails.aboutMe:
Good morning everyone.
My name is Manuel Griguoli. I would like to share my trading strategy, which is based on the following aspects:

1) diversification of the portfolio into shares (70%) and cryptocurrencies (30%). These percentages may vary according to the historical moment, to optimize possible earnings;
2) I only use leverage x1;
3) the minimum return target for open equity positions is 3-5% while the target for cryptocurrencies is 6-10%. These percentages may also vary, up or down, depending on the performance of the single position;
4) my transactions can be short, medium or long term.
I combine technical and fundamental analysis and monitor all assets, such as indices, as well as economies, politics and international relations to predict the general trend of large market segments.
Recommended minimum amount of $500. Copying of open or new positions depends on market weather.
For any information do not hesitate to contact me
Thanks and happy trading

