userDetails.aboutMe:
1) According to trading styles I would be best described as swing and position trader (positions are mostly held from a few days...up to 3 months);

2) I am focused on long/short multi-asset class trading strategies.

3) My goal is to reach highest possible risk adjusted return in portfolio;

4) I try to hold maximum drawdown in single digits (in some unprecedented events could be in teens).

5) I use my time doing market research and seeking trading opportunities and not much for communication through social networks;

6) Over a decade of trading experiences in financial markets;

7) You can start copy me with any amount.

8) Recommended time to copy is at least a few months (optimal is 1 year+).

9) When you are choosing "copier return to risk profile" choose 40/20 to make sure you won`t get stopped out in case if high intraday volatility emerges in portfolio holdings.

